      "dcterms:title": "Explicit evaluation of the q -Stokes matrices for certain conﬂuent hypergeometric q -diﬀerence equations",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Jinghong Lin, Yiming Ma",
        "Xu, Xiaomeng"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20241203",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.02281",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We prove a connection formula for the basic hypergeomtric function nϕn−1 (a1, ..., an−1, 0; b1, ..., bn−1; q, z) by using the q-Borel resummation. As an application, we compute q-Stokes matrices of a special conﬂuent hypergeometric q-diﬀerence system with an irregular singularity. We show that by letting q →1, the q-Stokes matrices recover the known expressions of the Stokes matrices of the corresponding conﬂuent hypergeometric diﬀerential system.",
